  "description": "At the Exit Lab, we’re running the Exit Skill Test to collect data on every visitor’s Exit Skill!\nWith your personal guide, the Examiner, leading the way, take on escape rooms crafted by our Lab researchers and boost that Exit Skill!\n\n■ Five Rooms, Each with Its Own Unique Style\nThe five rooms prepared for you all feature totally different themes, so every escape feels fresh and exciting.\nThis software offers a “Beginner Course,” perfect for first-time escape players.\n\n■ Explore & Solve Puzzles!\nEach room hides tons of items and tricky gimmicks.\nExploring every nook and cranny is the first step to escaping!\nCheck anything that feels suspicious and crack the gimmicks blocking your path!",
